  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b97b4914b800a270c516522b9af697dc176b359.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e84ea1620a5fb574fc32bdda57ca8319c3a29dc.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" border=\"10\"/>\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kingybu\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/877ebfd2654ffc553f963d6871513d935b3c741f.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" border=\"10\"/>\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kingybusiness/\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1bb902bda9644d160934a49c82aa5377c21fc04e.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" border=\"10\"/>\n            </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    厭倦了每次靠近附魔台，卻只看到跟工作台一樣的灰色介面嗎？想為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？隆重介紹「繽紛容器」！\n這是一個容器 GUI 替代模組，旨在讓每個選單都能匹配 Minecraft 中色彩繽紛的可互動方塊。\n撇開宣傳不談，這個材質包將取代工作台、熔爐等每個方塊的 GUI。每個新選單都會從其對應的方塊中汲取靈感，有些甚至還有動畫效果！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kingybusiness/\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b1bffa45a702faf668e0c0dbf3ac500976c135b.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" border=\"10\"/>\n            </a>\n</p>\n\n![preview](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0827f268aedbbdd141db8901e900d52fa7f30723.png)\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25ec88d0a4280c363ce8e6880a6b31050d74da85.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\"/>\n</p>\n\n- 鐵砧\n- 配方手冊\n- 高爐\n- 釀造台\n- 製圖台\n- 儲物箱（大型、小型、終界箱）**需 OptiGUI**\n- 工作台\n- 發射器\n- 投擲器\n- 附魔台\n- 熔爐\n- 砂輪\n- 漏斗\n- 紡織機\n- 界伏盒（所有顏色）**需 OptiGUI**\n- 煙燻爐\n- 切石機\n- 鍛造台\n- 木桶\n- 自訂村民 GUI **需 OptiGUI**\n- 烽火台\n- 合成器\n- 生存模式物品欄\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ccf71bfc1e97e6dba3be810afd4d8d80ffcce7c3.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\"/>\n</p>\n\n- 創造模式物品欄\n- 模組支援\n\n<p align=\"left\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f7fe74c90e1c2c59cc969e12bd49d2220ade505.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\"/>\n</p>\n\n**Chris_XENO**\n**BurntToast_**\n**Kingybu**",
